---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { site, where } from '../data/site';
---

<Base
  title={`Breathwork Sessions ${where} | ${site.name}`}
  description={`Somatic and conscious connected breathwork sessions with ${site.name} ${where.toLowerCase()}, one-to-one, in groups and on retreats.`}
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap narrow article">
      <div class="eyebrow">Breathwork</div>
      <h1>Breathwork Sessions {where}</h1>
      <p class="lead">
        Breathwork uses deliberate breathing patterns to calm the nervous system, release stored tension
        and reconnect you with your body. It is one of the most direct ways to change how you feel.
      </p>
      <div class="btn-row"><a class="btn" href={site.bookingUrl}>Book a free call</a></div>

      <h2>Somatic breathwork</h2>
      <p>
        Somatic breathwork focuses on sensation in the body. We use the breath to notice where you hold
        stress and tension and to let it move, often with a strong sense of release afterwards.
      </p>

      <h2>Conscious connected breathwork</h2>
      <p>
        A continuous breathing rhythm without pauses, held over a longer session. It can bring up and
        clear emotions that are hard to reach by talking.
      </p>

      <h2>One-to-one, groups and retreats</h2>
      <p>
        I offer private sessions online or in person, group sessions, and breathwork as a core part of
        every <a href="/retreats/">retreat</a>. Breathwork also runs through my
        <a href="/hypnosis/">hypnosis</a> work, where it helps the changes settle in the body.
      </p>

      <p class="note">
        Breathwork is not suitable for everyone. If you are pregnant, have epilepsy, a heart condition,
        high blood pressure or a history of psychosis, please tell me on our call before booking.
      </p>

      <div class="cta-box">
        <h2>Try a session</h2>
        <p>Start with a free call to find the right format for you.</p>
        <a class="btn" href={site.bookingUrl}>Book a free call</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
